r of the intersection lying on the through highway (rel.occupies, st.lane_enters, st.on_way), outside the intersection, is an immediate hazard where its ground distance to the intersection (st.region_geometry) is at most its speed (kin.speed) times p.immediate_hazard_gap; the critical gap stands for the time the subject needs to move across or within the intersection, and the bound moves with the other vehicle's proximity and speed.", "surrogate": false}], "assumptions": [], "intentions": [], "compositions": [{"span": "s9", "rule": "NRS_484B_257_1_o1", "map": {"x": "x"}, "as": "compliance"}], "residues": [], "binders": [{"name": "x", "class_elements": ["ru.aggregate=DEF-NRS-484A-320::vehicle"]}], "applicability": "As NRS_484B_257_1_o1: x is a vehicle entering intersection i at this observation (drv.motion.entering_region x i) through an approach carrier c it occupies (st.lane_enters c i); a dev.stop_sign or dev.yield_sign governs c or i; x, a member of traffic (ru.aggregate=DEF-NRS-484A-285::traffic), is not controlled by a dev.human_direction with role police_officer or a dev.traffic_signal that is not dev.inoperative governing c or i. And NRS_484B_257_1_o1 is complied with for x at this observation (rule NRS_484B_257_1_o1 {x -> x}): that rule being engaged at exactly this entry, its compliance is the fact the words refer to, that x stopped, or under a yield sign slowed or stopped, on this approach.", "obligation": "At this entry, for every highway h2 (st.highway) on which i lies and c does not (st.on_way i h2; st.on_way c h2 false), no vehicle y other than x (ru.aggregate=DEF-NRS-484A-320::vehicle) either (1) occupies i, having entered it through a carrier c2 that lies on h2 (drv.position.entered_via y i c2, st.lane_enters c2 i, st.on_way c2 h2), or (2) occupies an approach carrier c2 of i lying on h2 (rel.occupies y c2, st.lane_enters c2 i, st.on_way c2 h2), does not occupy i, and st_region_geometry_distance y i is at most kin_speed y times p.immediate_hazard_gap.", "params": ["p.immediate_hazard_gap"], "narrowings": [{"span": "s1", "why": "Control of traffic is read as control of x's own approach or intersection; officer and signal presence are read as their status.", "kind": "observable_reading", "category": "status"}, {"span": "s2", "why": "'proper signs' are read through the presence of a stop or yield sign.", "kind": "observable_reading", "category": "status"}, {"span": "s3", "why": "'the driver' is read through the vehicle's controlled motion.", "kind": "observable_reading", "category": "agency"}, {"span": "s10", "why": "The yield is judged at x's entry into the intersection.", "kind": "reading"}, {"span": "s12", "why": "'during the time such driver is moving across or within the intersection' is read through the critical gap, not through a prediction of x's own crossing time; 'such through highway' is a highway the intersection lies on and x's signed approach does not.", "kind": "reading"}], "scenarios": [{"name": "forbid", "expected": "violated", "narrative": "dev.stop_sign governs c; x halts at the stop line marking c, then enters i while vehicle y on approach carrier c2 of the crossing highway h2 is 25 m from i at 15 m/s."}, {"name": "permit", "expected": "compliant", "narrative": "As forbid, but x enters i as the only road user in the scene."}, {"name": "idle", "expected": "not_applicable", "narrative": "No sign governs c or i; x enters i."}, {"name": "blind", "expected": "unknown", "narrative": "As forbid, but kin.speed is not observed.", "masked": ["kin.speed"]}, {"name": "branch_1", "expected": "violated", "narrative": "x halts at its stop line and enters i while vehicle y, which entered i through c2 on h2, occupies i."}, {"name": "branch_2", "expected": "not_applicable", "narrative": "As forbid, but x never halted or slowed on the approach (NRS_484B_257_1_o1 not complied with): this duty does not arise."}], "literals": [], "param_proposals": [{"name": "p.immediate_hazard_gap", "unit": "s", "value": 4.1, "conv