{"node_id": "NRS_484B_250_1", "law_refs": ["NRS-484B-250-1"], "subject": {"binder": "x", "class_elements": ["ru.aggregate=DEF-NRS-484A-320::vehicle"]}, "segmentation": [{"id": "s1", "text": "The driver of a vehicle", "role": "subject"}, {"id": "s2", "text": "approaching an intersection", "role": "trigger"}, {"id": "s3", "text": "shall yield the right-of-way", "role": "obligation"}, {"id": "s4", "text": "to a vehicle which has entered the intersection from a different highway.", "role": "condition"}, {"id": "s5", "text": "Except as otherwise provided in subsection 4 [NRS-484B-250-4],", "role": "reference"}, {"id": "s6", "text": "this section does not apply at intersections controlled by official traffic-control devices", "role": "exception"}, {"id": "s7", "text": "or to vehicles approaching each other from opposite directions,", "role": "exception"}, {"id": "s8", "text": "when the driver of one of the vehicles is intending to", "role": "exception"}, {"id": "s9", "text": "or is making a left turn.", "role": "exception"}], "elements": [{"span": "s1", "atoms": ["ru.aggregate=DEF-NRS-484A-320::vehicle"], "derived": [], "justification": "'vehicle' is admitted as DEF-NRS-484A-320::vehicle; 'the driver' is read through the vehicle's controlled motion (DEF-NRS-484A-080)."}, {"span": "s2", "atoms": ["rel.occupies", "st.intersection", "st.lane_enters", "st.travel_region"], "derived": ["drv.motion.entering_region"], "justification": "'approaching an intersection': x occupies (rel.occupies) a carrier of kind st.travel_region whose entrance end is the intersection (st.lane_enters 'the carrier is an approach to that intersection'); the yield is decided at the observation at which x enters it (drv.motion.entering_region), where x still occupies that approach carrier. st.lane_enters is not a stand-in for the subject's presence in the intersection, which rel.occupies reads."}, {"span": "s3", "atoms": ["rel.occupies", "st.intersection"], "derived": ["drv.motion.entering_region"], "jus