{"node_id": "NRS_484B_270_4", "law_refs": ["NRS-484B-270-4"], "subject": {"binder": "x", "class_elements": ["ru.aggregate=DEF-NRS-484A-130::motor_vehicle"]}, "segmentation": [{"id": "s1", "text": "Except as otherwise provided in subsection 3 [NRS-484B-270-3],", "role": "reference"}, {"id": "s2", "text": "the driver of a motor vehicle", "role": "subject"}, {"id": "s3", "text": "shall not enter or proceed through an intersection", "role": "obligation"}, {"id": "s4", "text": "while driving within a pathway or lane provided for bicycles, electric bicycles or electric scooters.", "role": "condition"}], "elements": [{"span": "s2", "atoms": ["ru.aggregate=DEF-NRS-484A-130::motor_vehicle"], "derived": [], "justification": "'motor vehicle' is the admitted aggregate DEF-NRS-484A-130::motor_vehicle; 'the driver' is read through its controlled motion."}, {"span": "s3", "atoms": ["rel.occupies", "st.intersection"], "derived": ["drv.motion.entering_region"], "justification": "'shall not enter or proceed through an intersection': x's footprint does not overlap a st.intersection ('the region where two roadways meet'; DEF-NRS-484A-105), neither on entering it (drv.motion.entering_region) nor while proceeding through it (rel.occupies). st.intersection is not a stand-in for a crosswalk or stop line."}, {"span": "s4", "atoms": ["st.bicycle_lane_or_path", "rel.occupies", "kin.speed"], "derived": ["drv.motion.moving"], "justification": "'while driving within a pathway or lane provided for bicycles ...': x moving (drv.motion.moving) with its footprint on a st.bicycle_lane_or_path ('lane or separate path reserved for bicycles and the devices a jurisdiction groups with them'), at the same observation."}], "operationalizations": [], "assumptions": [], "intentions": [], "compositions": [{"span": "s1", "rule": "NRS_484B_270_3_o2", "map": {"x": "x"}, "as": "condition"}], "residues": [], "binders": [{"name": "x", "class_elements": ["ru.aggregate=DEF-NRS-484A-130::motor_vehicle"]}], "applicability": "x is a motor vehicle (ru.aggregate=DEF-NRS-484A-130::motor_vehicle), moving (drv.motion.moving x with p.speed_resolution) with its footprint on a bicycle lane or path b (st.bicycle_lane_or_path; rel.occupies x b), and NRS_484B_270_3_o2 applies to x at this observation (ruleApplies NRS_484B_270_3_o2 {x -> x}): its applicability holds exactly where none of the exceptions (a) to (f) of subsection 3 holds, which is what 'except as otherwise provided in subsection 3' leaves this duty to.", "obligation": "x's footprint overlaps no intersection at this observation (rel.occupies x i false for every i of kind st.intersection): x neither enters one (drv.motion.entering_region) nor proceeds through it.", "params": ["p.speed_resolution"], "narrowings": [{"span": "s2", "why": "'the driver' is read through the vehicle's controlled motion.", "kind": "observable_reading", "category": "agency"}], "scenarios": [{"name": "forbid", "expected": "violated", "narrative": "x, a passenger car, drives at 8 m/s in bicycle lane b up to the junction and its footprint overlaps both b and intersection i; no driveway, officer, conflict or official class."}, {"name": "permit", "expected": "compliant", "narrative": "x drives at 8 m/s in b 40 m upstream of i, its footprint overlapping no intersection, and leaves b before reaching i."}, {"name": "idle", "expected": "not_applicable", "narrative": "x drives in a general-traffic lane and never overlaps a bicycle lane or path."}, {"name": "blind", "expected": "unknown", "narrative": "As forbid, but rel.occupies of x and i is not observed.", "masked": ["rel.occupies"]}, {"name": "branch_1", "expected": "not_applicable", "narrative": "As forbid, but a dev.human_direction with role police_officer governs b and directs x through i (exception (e) of subsection 3)."}], "literals": [], "param_proposals": [{"name": "p.speed_resolution", "unit": "m/s", "value": 0.2, "convention": "Sensor resolution: the smallest speed the acquisition standard separates from s